#2418：https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase/issues/2418 duc2411

has been reproduced. \

As a temporary workaround, you can bypass it by setting alter system set _pushdown_storage_level=0; in the corresponding user tenant.

#### AVG_NULL_IN_NOT_IN_COUNT_DENOMINATOR_PUSHDOWN

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_db23_intpart;
CREATE DATABASE repro_db23_intpart;
USE repro_db23_intpart;

SET SESSION sql_mode='STRICT_ALL_TABLES,NO_ZERO_IN_DATE,NO_AUTO_CREATE_USER';
SET SESSION time_zone='+00:00';
SET SESSION group_concat_max_len=1048576;

CREATE TABLE src (
  vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,
  c0 DECIMAL(65,30) NULL,
  c1 BIGINT NOT NULL,
  PRIMARY KEY (c1, vp_rowid),
  KEY i1 (c1),
  KEY i2 (c1, c0)
) PARTITION BY HASH(c1) PARTITIONS 6;

INSERT INTO src (c0, c1) VALUES
  (0.2226402813894, 0),
  (0.6234580868362, 0),
  (0.7108584509363, 1);

CREATE TABLE l (
  vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,
  c1 BIGINT NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE r (
  vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,
  c0 DECIMAL(65,30) NULL
);

INSERT INTO l
SELECT vp_rowid, c1 FROM src ORDER BY vp_rowid;

INSERT INTO r
SELECT vp_rowid, c0 FROM src ORDER BY vp_rowid;

SELECT DISTINCT AVG(
  ((('-726911741') NOT IN ((363140572) IS NOT FALSE)) IN
   (((- (src.c1))) IN
      ((src.c1) > (NULL),
       EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM dual WHERE FALSE),
       0.30629758711845567)))
) AS single_ret
FROM src;

SELECT DISTINCT AVG(
  ((('-726911741') NOT IN ((363140572) IS NOT FALSE)) IN
   (((- (q.c1))) IN
      ((q.c1) > (NULL),
       EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM dual WHERE FALSE),
       0.30629758711845567)))
) AS split_ret
FROM (
  SELECT l.vp_rowid, r.c0, l.c1
  FROM l
  JOIN r ON l.vp_rowid = r.vp_rowid
) q;

single_ret = 0.6667
split_ret  = 1.0000

单表 EXPLAIN 关键形态：
SCALAR GROUP BY
└─ PX COORDINATOR
   └─ EXCHANGE OUT DISTR
      └─ MERGE GROUP BY
         └─ PX PARTITION ITERATOR
            └─ TABLE FULL SCAN src(i1)
关键点：
有 PX PARTITION ITERATOR
有 pushdown_aggregation
下推的是这组 SUM/COUNT 聚合
多表 EXPLAIN 关键形态：
SCALAR GROUP BY
└─ MERGE JOIN
   ├─ TABLE FULL SCAN r
   └─ TABLE FULL SCAN l
关键点：
多表侧没有分区表聚合下推
只是普通 MERGE JOIN + GROUP BY
返回 1.0000

AVG(expr) 下推时会拆成 SUM(expr) / COUNT(expr)，其中 COUNT(expr) 应严格忽略 NULL。但在这个版本的分区聚合下推实现中，优化器错误地将局部 COUNT(expr) 替换成了 COUNT(*)（或者合并阶段未能正确还原忽略 NULL 的语义），导致：

SUM = 1 + 1 + 0 = 2

COUNT = 3（错误地包含了 NULL 行）

最终 2/3 ≈ 0.6667

多表查询没有触发下推，直接计算 AVG，正确忽略 NULL，因此得到正确的 1.0000。